QMPaUws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5BWfZilIc1buI3LuIc7ENsm1DH6Bmqy0H_f2Mw9QV7LA&oe=6A05C987"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HVAC Package Unit Installation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HVAC Package Unit Installation is an immersive VR training application designed to simulate real-world installation procedures for HVAC package units. Learners engage in step-by-step, hands-on scenarios covering equipment positioning, connections, safety protocols, and system checks in a risk-free virtual environment.\nThis application is an integral component of the ImmerseLearn HVAC Package Unit Installation micro-credential program. It is not a standalone product access is exclusively granted to individuals enrolled in the program, ensuring a guided and structured learning experience.\nThrough interactive VR modules, users develop practical skills, improve accuracy, and build confidence before performing tasks in real-world settings. Ideal for aspiring technicians and professionals seeking experiential HVAC training.", "short_description": "Experience hands-on HVAC training in VR with the HVAC Package Unit Installation app. This simulation is part of the ImmerseLearn micro-credential program and provides guided, real-world installation practice. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program for structured, immersive skill development."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "inte